Bourgeois is a French surname .
Geographical distribution .
As of 2014 , 49.6 % of all known bearers of the surname &quot; Bourgeois &quot; were residents of France ( frequency 1 : 1,819 ) , 24.8 % of the United States ( 1 : 19,760 ) , 15.8 % of Canada ( 1 : 3,157 ) , 5.4 % of Belgium ( 1 : 2,892 ) and 1.5 % of Switzerland ( 1 : 7,254 ) .
