Kent Harrington is an American author of Fiction and Thrillers .
Background .
He attended the Palo Alto Military Academy and San Francisco State University , where he received a degree in Spanish literature . He lived in Spain and Latin America . Before becoming a novelist , he was a teacher , carpenter , factory worker and life insurance salesman .
